# Agent Guidelines & Project Notes

## 1. Project Scope & Architecture
- **Project:** Ahjar Oloum Store (متجر أحجار و علوم | Haute Gemology & Lapidary Science)
- **Status:** **UI DEMO ONLY**.
  - All interactive elements are demo-only UI placeholders unless explicitly requested.
  - The Search and Cart actions are UI icons only (no opening search bar, no cart checkout logic).
  - Language is primarily Arabic (`dir="rtl"`).

## 2. Design System & Palette

### Colors (Tailwind v4 `@theme inline`)
- **Primary (`#D4AF37`):** Gold highlight, primary action buttons, luxury accent details.
  - Available in shades `primary-50` through `primary-900`.
- **Secondary (`#0F4C81`):** Deep royal blue, headers, navigation elements.
  - Available in shades `secondary-50` through `secondary-900`.
- **Tertiary (`#0284C7`):** Ocean sky blue, links, badges, interactive accents.
  - Available in shades `tertiary-50` through `tertiary-900`.
- **Neutral (`#24211C`):** Charcoal dark espresso, body typography, dark surfaces.
  - Available in shades `neutral-50` through `neutral-900`.

### Typography
- **Cairo (`font-cairo`):** Default UI body font, navigation, and structured subheadings.
- **Lalezar (`font-lalezar`):** Heritage Arabic display font for main brand titles and hero headlines.
- **Lemonada (`font-lemonada`):** Contemporary cursive font for accent badges, prices, and special titles.
- **Typography Levels:**
  - 1. Title
  - 2. Subtitle
  - 3. Regular

## 3. Iconography
- Standard icon library: **Hugeicons** (`@hugeicons/react` / `@hugeicons/core-free-icons`).

## 4. Navigation & Layout
- Header component must feature:
  - Middle: **"أحجار و علوم"** (Brand Logo / Name)
  - Links: **"من نحن"** (About Us), **"اتصل بنا"** (Contact Us)
  - Action Icons: **Search** & **Cart** (display-only UI icons)
  - Responsive design with mobile drawer/menu toggle

